ollama (0.30.8+repack1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Split shared libraries into new libollama-common package containing CPU
    dispatch libraries and Vulkan backend
  * Add Replaces/Breaks to libollama-common for clean upgrades from older
    package layouts
  * Register /usr/lib/ollama/ on the standard library search path
  * Add postinst script to join the ollama user to render and video groups
  * Add +repackN suffix for rebuilds of the same upstream version
  * Add issue templates for bug reports and feature requests
  * Migrate from dh-sysuser to dh_installsysusers for user creation
  * Remove Multi-Arch: same from libollama-common to fix same-version
    reinstall on every apt dist-upgrade
  * Fix +repackN suffix to only apply to Debian package version metadata
  * Add versioned dependency libollama-common (= ${binary:Version}) to
    ollama, libollama-nvidia, and libollama-amd

 -- lingfish <lingfish@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 03 Jun 2026 17:00:48 +1000

